text:
“I am passionate, I am dark-haired,
I am the symbol of desire;
my soul is full of longing for pleasure.
Is it me you seek?” “No, not you.”

“My brow is pale, my tresses gold;
I can offer you endless joy;
I hold a treasure of tenderness.
Is it me you call?” “No, not you.”

“I am a dream, an impossibility,
an empty phantom of mist and light;
I have no body, I cannot be touched;
I cannot love you.” “Oh, come, come to me!”
